      "full_description":"Hikkaduwa brings together several versions of the south coast in one compact place. There are surf breaks for different abilities, a busy ribbon of cafés and small hotels, and a protected marine area just offshore. Its energy is brighter than the quieter beaches nearby, making it well suited to travellers who enjoy activity and choice.",
      "why_visit":"Choose Hikkaduwa for accessible surf, coastal nightlife and the chance to experience a coral-reef environment close to Galle.",
