      "nature_wildlife":"Hikkaduwa National Park protects a fringing coral reef and associated marine life. Reef experiences should never involve standing on coral, touching animals or feeding turtles.",
      "best_time_to_visit":"November to April generally brings calmer water, clearer snorkelling and favourable surf on the southwest coast.",
      "weather":"Warm and humid year-round, around 26–31°C. May to September is typically wetter and seas can be rougher under the southwest monsoon.",
