      "short_description":"A palm-framed southern bay known for ocean mornings, whale-watching journeys and relaxed evenings by the sea.",
      "full_description":"Mirissa curves around a photogenic bay where fishing boats, surf and beach cafés share the shoreline. Before sunrise, boats head into deeper water in search of whales; later, the pace returns to swimming, coastal viewpoints and unhurried meals. The town is popular, yet quieter moments remain easy to find at the edges of the day.",
